# No build-time environment variables are required.
#
# Plausible analytics is installed directly in src/layouts/Layout.astro. Its
# script id is public by design (it is served in the page source), so it lives
# in the code rather than here, where a gitignored file could silently break
# tracking on a fresh clone.
#
# The one secret this project uses is LOOPS_API_KEY, which is not a build-time
# variable. Set it on the deployed Worker with:
#   npx wrangler secret put LOOPS_API_KEY
# and locally by copying .dev.vars.example to .dev.vars.
